Let's find the slope between $(\blueD{-7},\blueD{9})$ and $(\maroonD{-8},\maroonD{-8})$:

$\begin{align}
\text{Slope}&=\dfrac{\blueD{9}-(\maroonD{-8})}{\blueD{-7}-(\maroonD{-8})}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{17}{1}
\\\\
&=17
\end{align}$
